          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And to the Gershonites, one of the families of the Levites, were given out of the half-tribe of Manasseh, Golan in Bashan with its pasture lands, the city of refuge for the slayer, and Be-eshterah with its pasture lands—two cities; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
