          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jarmuth with its pasture lands, En-gannim with its pasture lands—four cities; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and out of the tribe of Asher, Mishal with its pasture lands, Abdon with its pasture lands, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helkath with its pasture lands, and Rehob with its pasture lands—four cities; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
