          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and out of the tribe of Naphtali, Kedesh in Galilee with its pasture lands, the city of refuge for the slayer, Hammoth-dor with its pasture lands, and Kartan with its pasture lands—three cities. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
