              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And to the rest of the Levites, the Merarite families, were given out of the tribe of Zebulun, Jokne-am with its pasture lands, Kartah with its pasture lands, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.34",
