          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and out of the tribe of Reuben, Bezer with its pasture lands, Jahaz with its pasture lands, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedemoth with its pasture lands, and Mepha-ath with its pasture lands—four cities; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
