          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and out of the tribe of Gad, Ramoth in Gilead with its pasture lands, the city of refuge for the slayer, Mahanaim with its pasture lands, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heshbon with its pasture lands, Jazer with its pasture lands—four cities in all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.39"
            ]
          }
        },
